WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.703
-The president got booed
at the World Series

00:00:03.703 --> 00:00:05.438
a few days after we found out

00:00:05.438 --> 00:00:07.406
that his lawyer had butt-dialed
a reporter.

00:00:07.406 --> 00:00:09.475
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:09.475 --> 00:00:10.910
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:14.113 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:14.113 --> 00:00:16.316
Obviously those things
are not related.

00:00:16.316 --> 00:00:19.084
It is a sign of how crazy
everything is right now.

00:00:19.084 --> 00:00:20.486
On Friday we found out

00:00:20.486 --> 00:00:22.888
that President Trump's
personal lawyer Rudy Giuliani

00:00:22.888 --> 00:00:25.625
had accidentally butt-dialed
a reporter twice

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:28.895
leaving voicemails about Ukraine
and Rudy's need for cash,

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:31.431
which means we are officially
at the point where these guys

00:00:31.431 --> 00:00:34.601
are confessing out of their
mouths and out of their asses.

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:35.869
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:38.037
The next time they talk about
leaks,

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:41.574
remember, they mean Rudy's ass.

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:43.276
And then less than two days
later,

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:45.778
everyone had to shift from
Butt-dialgate to the news

00:00:45.778 --> 00:00:47.647
that the leader of ISIS
had been killed

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:49.582
after the president cryptically
tweeted,

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:52.385
"Something very big
has just happened."

00:00:52.385 --> 00:00:54.120
He tweets about a huge
intelligence

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:56.055
and military victory
for the United States

00:00:56.055 --> 00:00:58.824
like a stepdad who just scored
backstage passes

00:00:58.824 --> 00:01:01.027
to Hootie &amp; the Blowfish.

00:01:01.027 --> 00:01:03.229
[ Gruff voice ] Kevin, I know
you're not my biological son,

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:05.765
but you are about to wish you
were because something very big

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:07.834
has just happened.

00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:10.936
And yet another sign of just how
much of a roller coaster

00:01:10.936 --> 00:01:13.839
Trump's presidency has been,
in that two-day span,

00:01:13.839 --> 00:01:15.074
he went from the low

00:01:15.074 --> 00:01:16.709
of his personal lawyer
butt-dialing a reporter

00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:19.145
to the high of killing the
world's most wanted terrorist,

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:20.546
and then that same day,

00:01:20.546 --> 00:01:23.216
back to the low of getting booed
at the World Series.

00:01:23.216 --> 00:01:25.785
-President Trump greeted by boos
by many

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:27.520
at game five of the World Series

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.588
between the Astros
and the Nationals.

00:01:29.588 --> 00:01:32.425
-The President and First Lady
of the United States.

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:35.261
[ Crowd booing ]

00:01:40.499 --> 00:01:43.036
-Now, you may think that I have
two beers right now

00:01:43.036 --> 00:01:45.137
to celebrate Donald Trump
getting booed,

00:01:45.137 --> 00:01:48.241
but I'm actually holding two
beers to celebrate this guy

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:49.541
who took a ball in the chest
last night

00:01:49.541 --> 00:01:52.345
rather than drop his.

00:01:52.345 --> 00:01:54.046
That guy had a better night

00:01:54.046 --> 00:01:56.782
than the president
of the United States.

00:01:56.782 --> 00:02:01.120
That guy right there.

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:02.788
That guy took a ball
to his chest

00:02:02.788 --> 00:02:05.591
rather than drop his beers
and jumped ahead of Joe Biden

00:02:05.591 --> 00:02:07.560
in the primary.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:08.894
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.894 --> 00:02:11.163
But really, the best part was
just watching the joy

00:02:11.163 --> 00:02:14.700
drain out of Trump's face as he
realized he was getting booed.

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:16.001
I mean, look at that.

00:02:16.001 --> 00:02:18.571
He's like kid on Christmas who
sees a giant present

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:21.207
and then opens it and it's just
a box full of packing peanuts

00:02:21.207 --> 00:02:22.841
and a Yankee candle.

00:02:22.841 --> 00:02:27.347
What scent is this?
Damn it!

00:02:27.347 --> 00:02:29.482
Now, again, this raid
was a major military

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:31.317
and intelligence victory
for the United States,

00:02:31.317 --> 00:02:33.886
and yet, even in announcing
such a huge achievement,

00:02:33.886 --> 00:02:35.721
Trump couldn't help but do
what he always does --

00:02:35.721 --> 00:02:37.156
make it super weird.

00:02:37.156 --> 00:02:39.492
-Today President Trump announced
that ISIS leader

00:02:39.492 --> 00:02:43.796
Abu Bakr al-Baghdadi was killed
in a raid by U.S. special forces

00:02:43.796 --> 00:02:45.598
