00:02:45.598 --> 00:02:49.368
-I got to watch it
in the situation room.

00:02:49.368 --> 00:02:52.438
And we watched it, uh...

00:02:52.438 --> 00:02:53.239
so clearly.

00:02:53.239 --> 00:02:54.841
We had absolutely perfect --

00:02:54.841 --> 00:02:57.075
As though you were watching
a movie.

00:02:57.075 --> 00:03:02.281
It was -- The technology there
alone is really great.

00:03:02.281 --> 00:03:03.582
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.582 --> 00:03:06.618
-Honestly I would not be
surprised if to keep him busy

00:03:06.618 --> 00:03:07.753
