Tom Cruise was there.

00:03:13.058 --> 00:03:15.494
He put on his flight suit,
jumped out of the plane.

00:03:15.494 --> 00:03:17.029
And, you know,
just let me assure you,

00:03:17.029 --> 00:03:18.497
